。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji058-026","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AA","title":"梁王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-058-liang","source_id":"s-shiji-058-liang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p013","quote":"梁孝王長子買為梁王，是為共王；子明為濟川王；子彭離為濟東王；子定為山陽王；子不識為濟陰王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji058-026:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p013","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"梁王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m013-0007","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-058-liang","source_id":"s-shiji-058-liang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p013","quote":"梁孝王長子買為梁王，是為共王；子明為濟川王；子彭離為濟東王；子定為山陽王；子不識為濟陰王。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授封、改封、敘事用稱與諡稱分存；相對年數及來源年號保留，不換算公曆，不從首次用稱或死亡補任期。未名群體不造個別官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji058-027","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AA","title":"共王","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-058-liang","source_id":"s-shiji-058-liang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p013","quote":"梁孝王長子買為梁王，是為共王；子明為濟川王；子彭離為濟東王；子定為山陽王；子不識為濟陰王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji058-027:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p013","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"共王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m013-0012","usage":"retrospective"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授封、改封、敘事用稱與諡稱分存；相對年數及來源年號保留，不換算公曆，不從首次用稱或死亡補任期。未名群體不造個別官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji058-021","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AA","surfaces":["共王","梁共王","梁王","買"],"scope":"same_