{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m013-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"濟東王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m013-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"定","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m013-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"山陽王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m013-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"不識","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m013-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"濟陰王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AE","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-058-liang","book_id":"b-shiji-058","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-058-liang"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p015","text":"梁共王三年，景帝崩。共王立七年卒，子襄立，是為平王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m015-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"梁共王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m015-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m015-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m015-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m015-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-058-liang","book_id":"b-shiji-058","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-058-liang"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p016","text":"梁平王襄十四年，母曰陳太后。共王母曰李太后。李太后，親平王之大母也。而平王之后姓任，曰任王后。任王后甚有寵於平王襄。初，孝王在時，有罍樽，直千金。孝王誡後世，善保罍樽，無得以與人。任王后聞而欲得罍樽。平王大母李太后曰：「先王有命，無得以罍樽與人。他物雖百巨萬，猶自恣也。」任王后絕欲得之。平王襄直使人開府取罍樽，賜任王后。李太后大怒，漢使者來，欲自言，平王襄及任王后遮止，閉門，李太后與爭門，措指，遂不得見漢使者。李太后亦私與食官長及郎中尹霸等士通亂，而王與任王后以此使人風止李太后，李太后內有淫行，亦已。後病薨。病時，任后未嘗請病；薨，又不持喪。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"梁平王襄","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"陳太后","kind":"person","person_id":"hi5_2q4_qme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"李太后","kind":"person","person_id":"ja1_60d_r62","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"李太后","kind":"person","person_id":"ja1_60d_r62","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"大母","kind":"person","person_id":"ja1_60d_r62","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"任王后","kind":"person","person_id":"261_d2j_rm9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0047","start":47,"end":50,"surface":"任王后","kind":"person","person_id":"261_d2j_rm9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"平王襄","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m016-0060","start":60,"en